WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,170
Dad

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:02,740
I met Zhang Xiaojun in the mountains today

3
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,100
He wants to steal a piece of water from me

4
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,500
My hand stepped on it

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,920
Who is the son of Zhang Dabiao?

6
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,080
Let's occupy it

7
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:11,690
Then step on it

8
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:13,730
I also dealt with his father twice back then.

9
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,130
If he troubles you again

10
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:17,980
I'll beat his dad up

11
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:19,980
Just your legs and feet are fine

12
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,500
His father's legs and feet are not as good as mine.

13
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:32,440
I'm pissing all over the aisle. The second sister is here to deliver some goods to you. There's bear meat and bear oil.

14
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,800
There are also two bags of milk powder and two bottles of Mairujing Chunlan for An An.

15
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:37,560
Dad also bought you a Sanfeng mechanical watch.

16
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,920
How can a married girl accept these things? Don’t have a tacit understanding

17
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:48,680
My daughter is also getting married. Hurry up and try this fat boy from the second sister.

18
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:49,760
It's too light to start with.

19
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:54,280
Your brother-in-law, Brother Tang, is not allowed to bully An An in front of adults.

20
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:55,720
Second Grandpa will give you a wheat box.

21
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,460
This old man is really quick

22
00:00:59,750 --> 00:01:02,980
Men wear a watch outside to look smart. Why don't you wear it?

23
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:07,480
I don't care about this old nonsense. Put it on, second sister.

24
00:01:07,870 --> 00:01:08,870
I came here last time

25
00:01:09,030 --> 00:01:10,350
I gave An An two bottles of Mairujing.

26
00:01:10,590 --> 00:01:17,570
At that time, I gave it to my second brother-in-law. He was wearing Mairujing and didn’t see it, Dad.

27
00:01:17,570 --> 00:01:20,690
Why don't you discuss this with me? It has a wheat-like essence but is very light.

28
00:01:20,890 --> 00:01:21,850
Only recharged one bowl's worth

29
00:01:22,010 --> 00:01:25,080
This old cicada has caused trouble to the second uncle

30
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:27,500
You are An An's job

31
00:01:33,540 --> 00:01:34,740
You give your granddaughter rice soup

32
00:01:34,740 --> 00:01:40,550
Why are you giving Mairujing to your grandnephew's children?

33
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,800
Just because you can't give birth to a son

34
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:45,160
Isn’t this girl just a loser?

35
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,120
I put the wheat as a filial piety to my mother

36
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,440
I won't feed this loser either.

37
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:49,640
She will get married in the future

38
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:53,000
Can you give me a fan? Lao Deng, please say it again.

39
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:55,320
No matter how much I eat, I don’t feel bad

40
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,240
An An drinks a bowl full of white shrimps

41
00:01:57,280 --> 00:02:07,240
I'll go to hell with you. If you have anything to say,

42
00:02:10,140 --> 00:02:11,220
Your eyes are really blind

43
00:02:11,420 --> 00:02:13,820
Just watch your daughter being bullied like this. Stop beating her.

44
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:14,980
I really don't know

45
00:02:18,010 --> 00:02:27,860
I'll beat you to death today no matter what

46
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:29,820
It's not okay to bully our old Chen family
